# Fe-Ag alloy potential (Lennard-Jones for demonstration)
# Note: For real simulations, use a proper EAM potential

# Pair coefficients for Fe-Fe, Ag-Ag, Fe-Ag interactions

# Fe-Fe interaction (approximate)
pair_coeff 1 1 0.1 2.5

# Ag-Ag interaction (approximate)  
pair_coeff 2 2 0.15 2.8

# Fe-Ag cross interaction (approximate)
pair_coeff 1 2 0.125 2.65
